    },
    {
      "id": "Z4hMGbygXXCRAI0bdgw9C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 448.27000794919184,
      "y": 564.9533158678307,
      "width": 379.19970703125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 446036870,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 470467098,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786938252188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Serve relevant sponsored products\n2. Keyword / product targeting\n3. Rank candidates / run auction\n4. Enforce campaign budget & schedule\n5. Validate ad eligibility\n6. Return top N ads\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Serve relevant sponsored products\n2. Keyword / product targeting\n3. Rank candidates / run auction\n4. Enforce campaign budget & schedule\n5. Validate ad eligibility\n6. Return top N ads\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Iibp9aCTaLk5Ed0uG_GIp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 443.18012605376106,
      "y": 832.1226791029553,
      "width": 409.439697265625,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 627452634,
      "version": 340,
      "versionNonce": 1717826694,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786938346224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. Low latency\n   p99 < 100 ms\n\n2. High availability\n   Ads must not block organic search\n\n3. Massive scale\n   Millions of requests/sec\n\n4. Fault tolerant\n   Graceful degradation\n\n5. Config freshness\n   Campaign changes visible within seconds\n\n6. Consistency\n   Stronger guarantees for spend/budget\n   Eventual consistency for serving index\n\n7. Observable\n   Metrics / logs / tracing",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. Low latency\n   p99 < 100 ms\n\n2. High availability\n   Ads must not block organic search\n\n3. Massive scale\n   Millions of requests/sec\n\n4. Fault tolerant\n   Graceful degradation\n\n5. Config freshness\n   Campaign changes visible within seconds\n\n6. Consistency\n   Stronger guarantees for spend/budget\n   Eventual consistency for serving index\n\n7. Observable\n   Metrics / logs / tracing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x6gCKoJ-P6WWIZmKU9g2C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 907.9945073734208,
      "y": 555.816502723649,
      "width": 511.0397033691406,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1966286086,
      "version": 542,
      "versionNonce": 322613018,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786938261089,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API\n\nPOST /v1/ads:serve\n{\n  query,\n  placement (SEARCH_RESULTS, PRODUCT_PAGE),\n  maxAds,\n\n  contextProductId?,\n  userId?,\n  sessionId?,\n  pageNumber?,\n  device?,\n  location?\n} ->\n{\n  ads: [\n    {\n      adId,\n      productId\n    }\n  ]\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\n\nPOST /v1/ads:serve\n{\n  query,\n  placement (SEARCH_RESULTS, PRODUCT_PAGE),\n  maxAds,\n\n  contextProductId?,\n  userId?,\n  sessionId?,\n  pageNumber?,\n  device?,\n  location?\n} ->\n{\n  ads: [\n    {\n      adId,\n      productId\n    }\n  ]\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EktvSpxXuNZbOXn5KQUWj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 702.8464607578069,
      "y": 419.6431796695446,
      "width": 1314.599365234375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 442155014,
      "version": 167,
      "versionNonce": 1090019738,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786864136859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When a customer searches for a product on Walmart.com or the Walmart mobile app, the system \nshould determine whether sponsored products should be displayed and, if so, select the most \nrelevant ads for available ad placements.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When a customer searches for a product on Walmart.com or the Walmart mobile app, the system \nshould determine whether sponsored products should be displayed and, if so, select the most \nrelevant ads for available ad placements.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
